%% Prescription lifecycle (prescriptions.status)
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> PENDING: consultation submitted /<br/>prescription added
  PENDING --> IN_PROGRESS: start (pharmacist)
  PENDING --> DISPENSED: dispense (pharmacist)
  IN_PROGRESS --> DISPENSED: dispense (pharmacist)
  PENDING --> CANCELLED: cancel (prescribing doctor / pharmacist, reason)
  IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED: cancel (prescribing doctor / pharmacist, reason)
  DISPENSED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  note right of DISPENSED
    terminal - dispensing outcome FULL or PARTIAL,
    exactly one dispensings row
  end note
  note right of CANCELLED
    terminal - may be superseded
    by a re-issued prescription
  end note
